  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kingerikiti AMCOS Coffee Value Addition Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: The AMCOS is in the coffee value chain by producing quality coffee and selling it to the export market. Beneficiaries: More than 1,400 members and local farmers benefit directly from the project through access to timely supply of inputs, extension services and market access..Description: The coffee value chain entails production and centrally pulping the coffee to enhance quality. The famers aggregate their coffee and sell it through the coffee auction or export it directly to buyers offering higher prices than that offered at the auction.</narrative>
  </description>
